{
	"nodes":[
		{
			"id":"584583ca5b5f2c4b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"After unlocking [[The Precipice.canvas|The Precipice]] through the [[Blue Fire Puzzle.canvas|Blue Fire Puzzle]], you need to draft rooms until you have at least one of each chess piece.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-560,
			"y":-380,
			"width":440,
			"height":120,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"9f18c643f25d7639",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Queen and King comes from [[026 - Study.canvas|026 - Study]] and [[024 - Office.canvas|024 - Office]]",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-530,
			"y":-200,
			"width":380,
			"height":80,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"5bc2b4e3dc98b395",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"After drafting those rooms, go to [[The Precipice.canvas|The Precipice]], go to the chess puzzle and place the pieces exactly on where the rooms with the respective chess pieces are, this should solve the puzzle.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-530,
			"y":-60,
			"width":380,
			"height":160,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"3053094b9079d280",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"This could be related to [[Precipice Door Puzzle.canvas|Precipice Door Puzzle]] and [[Precipice Castle Puzzle.canvas|Precipice Castle Puzzle]].\n\nSpecially because \"castling\" is a certain type of move that exists in Chess.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-510,
			"y":160,
			"width":340,
			"height":200
		}
	],
